OL,3,GNEWSATherapy farm facing closure unless
OL,4,Anew home found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project which helps people manage
OL,7,Ftheir mental health through farming and
OL,8,Fhorticulture says it faces closure
OL,9,Funless it can find a new home in under
OL,10,Fa year.
OL,12,FThe Garden Army in West Hoathly, near
OL,13,FEast Grinstead, is coming into its
OL,14,Fseventh year after being founded by Tom
OL,15,FMorphew, who was inspired by a
OL,16,Fconversation with a late friend who had
OL,17,Fpost-traumatic stress disorder (PTSD).
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
